{"synopsis":"Yeon Chungwoon, murid luar dari Sekte Wudang, yang telah lama ingin masuk sekte utama, mendapati dirinya mengalami hari-hari yang sulit setelah diasingkan oleh rekannya, Yoon Sihu, putra tertua Klan Deokpung Yoon. Tiba-tiba, suatu hari dia mendengar suara yang tidak terduga… Maka dimulailah perjalanan komunikasi yang aneh antara Yeon Chungwoon,\nyang telah mendapatkan koneksi ke surga, dan para master yang hanya ingin berhenti bekerja hingga larut malam.","alternative_title":"The Masters Are Subscribing 사부님들이 구독 중","author":"Ha Kangho, Heuk Ya","artist":"Kim Kibaek","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"8e62b2eb-d0bc-4d0f-8952-3c2115c29aae","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2026-03-21","released":"2026-03-21","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_74/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"04e9a267-cc1d-4b7c-aad9-1ec30a8f5fb5","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"","date":"2026-01-18","released":"2026-01-18","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_63451fc2-b46e-4056-aac6-19854f56be14/chapter_ch_73/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/ch